# X.com URL handling

If a source URL is on `x.com` (including `/status/` links), **use the built-in browser MCP** to access and extract the post text.

- Do **not** use Firecrawl for `x.com` links (it is blocklisted / unreliable).
- If you hit cookie/login interstitials, interact via the browser MCP (accept cookies, then re-snapshot) until the post text is visible.

